        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47. I think you already know about death of Alexey Navalny. His body is secretly removed to Hokkaido, where Russian and Japanese secret services trying to open his body to sell his heart and brain. But his international friends from &quot;The Navalny Gang&quot; are going to paint Navalny&apos;s body in magical &quot;Zelyonka&quot; to ressurect him. You need to stop him, because ressurection of Navalny is going to making him Jesus. Good luck, 47.",
